{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach it. If reached, take it. Then move to and complete task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
